<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Build-QA proof of L3-E2-D-V4 cascade_qa template — qa-proof</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --fg: #111;
    --fg-muted: #555;
    --bg: #fafafa;
    --bg-card: #fff;
    --border: #d6d6d6;
    --accent: #1f4ed8;
    --pill-bg: #eef1f8;
    --pill-fg: #1f4ed8;
    --state-todo: #6b7280;
    --state-in_progress: #b45309;
    --state-complete: #047857;
    --state-failed: #b91c1c;
    --state-archived: #4b5563;
  }
  html { color-scheme: light; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--fg);
    font: 1rem/1.55 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  main {
    max-width: 56rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem 2rem;
  }
  header {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  header h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }
  .qa-tag {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
  }
  .qa-target {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
  }
  .qa-target code {
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--fg);
    word-break: break-all;
  }
  .pills {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }
  .pill {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.125rem 0.55rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    background: var(--pill-bg);
    color: var(--pill-fg);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .pill[data-key="state"][data-value="todo"] { background: #e5e7eb; color: var(--state-todo); }
  .pill[data-key="state"][data-value="in_progress"] { background: #fef3c7; color: var(--state-in_progress); }
  .pill[data-key="state"][data-value="complete"] { background: #d1fae5; color: var(--state-complete); }
  .pill[data-key="state"][data-value="failed"] { background: #fee2e2; color: var(--state-failed); }
  .pill[data-key="state"][data-value="archived"] { background: #e5e7eb; color: var(--state-archived); }
  .pill[data-key="outcome"][data-value="pass"]    { background: #d1fae5; color: var(--state-complete); }
  .pill[data-key="outcome"][data-value="success"] { background: #d1fae5; color: var(--state-complete); }
  .pill[data-key="outcome"][data-value="fail"]    { background: #fee2e2; color: var(--state-failed); }
  .pill[data-key="outcome"][data-value="failure"] { background: #fee2e2; color: var(--state-failed); }
  .pill[data-key="outcome"][data-value="blocked"] { background: #ede9fe; color: #5b21b6; }
  .pill-role-qa-proof          { background: #eef1f8; color: #1f4ed8; }
  .pill-role-qa-falsification  { background: #fef3c7; color: #b45309; }
  section {
    margin-block: 1.25rem;
  }
  section h2 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    color: var(--fg);
  }
  dl.meta {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: max-content 1fr;
    column-gap: 1rem;
    row-gap: 0.35rem;
    margin: 0;
  }
  dl.meta dt {
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }
  dl.meta dd {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    word-break: break-word;
  }
  ul.flat {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
  }
  ul.flat li { margin-block: 0.1rem; }
  pre.prose {
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--fg);
    margin: 0;
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
    background: transparent;
    border: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
  footer {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
  }
  @media (max-width: 32rem) {
    body { padding: 0.75rem; }
    main { padding: 1rem; }
    dl.meta { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    dl.meta dt { margin-top: 0.5rem; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main aria-labelledby="qa-title">
  <header>
    <div class="qa-tag">cascade.qa-proof</div>
    <h1 id="qa-title">Build-QA proof of L3-E2-D-V4 cascade_qa template</h1>
    <div class="qa-target">target_id: <code>drop_004.drop.builder_l3_e2_dv4_cascade_qa_template</code></div>
    <div class="pills" aria-label="QA metadata">
      <span class="pill pill-role-qa-proof" data-key="role" data-value="qa-proof">qa-proof</span>
      <span class="pill" data-key="state" data-value="complete">complete</span>
      <span class="pill" data-key="outcome" data-value="pass">pass</span>
      
    </div>
  </header>

  <section aria-label="Identifiers and timestamps">
    <h2>Identifiers</h2>
    <dl class="meta">
      <dt>parent_id</dt><dd>drop_004.drop.l3_e2_simple_views</dd>
      <dt>created_at</dt><dd><time datetime="2026-05-18T17:00:00Z">2026-05-18T17:00:00Z</time></dd>
      <dt>updated_at</dt><dd><time datetime="2026-05-18T17:30:00Z">2026-05-18T17:30:00Z</time></dd>
      <dt>started_at</dt><dd><time datetime="2026-05-18T17:00:00Z">2026-05-18T17:00:00Z</time></dd>
      <dt>completed_at</dt><dd><time datetime="2026-05-18T17:30:00Z">2026-05-18T17:30:00Z</time></dd>
    </dl>
  </section>

  
  <section aria-label="Objective">
    <h2>Objective</h2>
    <pre class="prose">Verify build evidence completeness. Attack payload: &lt;script&gt;alert(&#39;xss&#39;)&lt;/script&gt;</pre>
  </section>
  

  

  
  <section aria-label="Findings">
    <h2>Findings</h2>
    <pre class="prose">Template renders both roles. Golden compare passes &#43; substring asserts pin role-pill class differentiation.</pre>
  </section>
  

  

  
  <footer aria-label="Transition notes">
    <strong>Transition notes:</strong> Build-QA proof complete; ready for falsification pass.
  </footer>
  

  
</main>
</body>
</html>
